<view wx:if="{{show}}" class="rp-mask" bindtap="cancel">
  <view class="rp-panel" catchtap="noop">
    <view class="rp-title">登记还款</view>
    <view class="rp-sub">{{label}} · 待还 ¥{{owed}}</view>

    <view class="lbl">这次还了多少</view>
    <input class="ipt" type="digit" placeholder="不填 = 全额 ¥{{owed}}"
           value="{{amount}}" bindinput="onInput" />
    <view class="tip">少于全额时按时间先后核销，钱不够整笔的那一笔会拆成「已还＋未还」两条。逐笔操作可在明细里点「标已还」。</view>

    <view class="rp-acts">
      <view class="btn ghost rp-btn" catchtap="cancel">取消</view>
      <view class="btn rp-btn" catchtap="confirm">登记</view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
